      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manistee%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the lumber boom of the 1880s, Manistee hosted its own railroad, the Manistee and North‑Eastern, and boasted more millionaires per capita than any U.S. city.",
